{
  "schema": "portal2-scenarios/v1",
  "description": "Scripted Portal 2 gameplay scenarios for carried objects: Wheatley's pickups and sockets from sp_a1_intro7 through sp_a2_core, and a weighted cube on a floor button. Run by tools/quality/portal2_scenarios.py; each scenario must print every required check as PASS and then QA_DONE.",
